  - id: 8ae7259e-7fd0-4ce7-9b0d-601cde7404fd
    text: You go into the negotiation reasonably and present your figure. The client
      presents a slightly lower figure. You agree, sacrificing a small amount of
      your profit even though you are contractually due the money and could argue
      it.
